x='349.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>recommendation</text><text x='349.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>最多三项优先建议</text><line x1='407' y1='84' x2='433' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M433 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='447' y='40' width='103' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='498.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>validation_target</text><text x='498.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>验证目标</text><line x1='556' y1='84' x2='582' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M582 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='596' y='40' width='103' height='88' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='647.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>followup 关联补测</text><text x='647.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>题干哈希排除原题重做</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>链路与缺口</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>已有“发现问题 — 提出验证目标 — 关联补测证据”的基础，不应整体列作遗漏功能。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>考后问卷补充自述（卡题、跳题、检查、信心、状态），属自述证据，不是客观笔迹时间戳。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>缺口一：无按候选原因自动生成区分性小题。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>缺口二：无逐轮自适应选择下一诊断题。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>缺口三：无自动停止机制。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>边界：不得将当前关联一条练习记录直接等同于所有自动流程均已实现。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：当前实现能力与名词数量.md §9</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 20 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>